msgstr "``name`` 및 ``value``\\만 필요합니다. 쿠키를 삭제하려면 ``value``\\를 공백으로 설정하세요."

#: ../../source/outgoing/response.rst:426
msgid ""
"The ``expire`` is set in **seconds**, which will be added to the current "
"time. Do not include the time, but rather only the number of seconds from "
